Answers to some of your questions: 

1. Eat them or tin them. Freezing them or boxing them could also work, but I
haven't tried that.
2. Helm of telepathy, helm of brilliance are my faves, although any hard helm
with lots of +'es is good. (I found a +5 orcish helm the other day.)
3. Too long to list here. As a general rule, any monster that has a special
ability might confer a resistance to it when eaten, fire giants -- fire res., 
blue jellies -- cold res., etc. Puddings, oozes, and gelatinous cubes give
a variety of intrinsics, elves give sleep res., teleporting monsters give 
teleportation and (sometimes) tele ctrl., etc.
4. I'm still researching that myself... :-)
5. Polymorphing an item may disintegrate it. Putting an item into a cursed bag
of holding may eventually destroy it. Creatures are more difficult; maybe you
could try reflecting a black dragon breath on them... ;-)

